{"id":"wb-5-315","name":"亳州古地道","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"亳州古地道","text":"亳州古地道位于中国安徽省亳州市谯城区老城区地下，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n亳州古地道始建于东汉末年，现存大部分为宋代所建。全长4000余米，以大隅首为中心向四周延伸，一般深2.5～4米，最深达7米以上，内部高度在1.8米左右。其结构有土木结构、砖木结构和砖结构三种，以砖结构最多。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%B3%E5%B7%9E%E5%8F%A4%E5%9C%B0%E9%81%93","revisionId":91488715,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91488715","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/58142c38659e083fc0e0c76a.jpg","title":"20260210_Ancient_Tunnels_of_Bozhou_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260210_Ancient_Tunnels_of_Bozhou_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/20260210_Ancient_Tunnels_of_Bozhou_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​亳州古地道","width":320,"height":213}}